                                    <p>The tablet is inscribed on <rs type="sides" key="opisthographic">both sides</rs>. The surface of face A shows extensive traces of erasure. The tablet bears an inscription on each side by the same hand: a question on face A (<bibl><ptr target="#IDodoneDVC"/> <citedRange>24A+25A</citedRange></bibl>) and a summary of the same question on face B. The last three lines of the inscription on face A were written in smaller letters and positioned towards the right edge of the tablet to fit the available space. They are separated from the preceding text by a finely incised line. Use of interpunct.</p>
